  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-orange pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Radiative-Heat Conversion</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b2/350px-Acotilletta2--Red_Hulk_transformation_600px.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20111104025130\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"350px-Acotilletta2--Red Hulk transformation 600px\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b2/350px-Acotilletta2--Red_Hulk_transformation_600px.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20111104025130\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b2/350px-Acotilletta2--Red_Hulk_transformation_600px.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20111104025130 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b2/350px-Acotilletta2--Red_Hulk_transformation_600px.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20111104025130 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"350px-Acotilletta2--Red Hulk transformation 600px\" width=\"270\" height=\"179\" data-image-key=\"350px-Acotilletta2--Red_Hulk_transformation_600px.jpg\" data-image-name=\"350px-Acotilletta2--Red Hulk transformation 600px.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Red Hulk (Marvel Comics) can absorb radiation and convert it to heat energy.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb radiation and convert it to heat.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb radiation and convert it to heat</b>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Heating\" title=\"Energetic Heating\">Energetic Heating</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRadiative-Heat_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb radiation and convert it to heat, manipulating it however they please.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRadiative-Heat_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiation_Conversion\" title=\"Radiation Conversion\">Radiation Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Heat_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Heat Manipulation\">Bio-Heat Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Thermic_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Thermic Manipulation\">Bio-Thermic Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Manipulation\" title=\"Heat Manipulation\">Heat Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Thermal_Ionization\" title=\"Thermal Ionization\">Thermal Ionization</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Heat\" title=\"Personal Heat\">Personal Heat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiative-Plasma_Conversion\" title=\"Radiative-Plasma Conversion\">Radiative-Plasma Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ionic_Manipulation\" title=\"Ionic Manipulation\">Ionic Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Plasma_Manipulation\" title=\"Plasma Manipulation\">Plasma Manipulation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radioactive_Energizing\" title=\"Radioactive Energizing\">Radioactive Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiation_Absorption\" title=\"Radiation Absorption\">Radiation Absorption</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRadiative-Heat_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Alien_Physiology\" title=\"Alien Physiology\">Alien Physiology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ambient_Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Ambient Energy Conversion\">Ambient Energy Conversion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Generation\" title=\"Heat Generation\">Heat Generation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRadiative-Heat_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Power may be limited to how much radiation user has/can absorb.</li>\n<li>Opposing <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a> powers, <a href=\"/wiki/Cold_Manipulation\" title=\"Cold Manipulation\">Cold Manipulation</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Radiation_Manipulation\" title=\"Radiation Manipulation\">Radiation Manipulation</a> can weaken user.</li>\n<li>The user may be at a disadvantage in environments that lack energy to absorb.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRadiative-Heat_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Ronald_Raymond_(Prime_Earth)\">Firestorm</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Fuego_(Earth-616)#Powers\">Fuego</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Lucas_Bishop_(Earth-1191)#Powers\">Lucas Bishop</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Thaddeus_Ross_(Earth-616)#Powers\">Red Hulk</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Shiro_Yoshida_(Earth-616)#Powers\">Sunfire</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Roberto_Da_Costa_(Earth-616)#Powers\">Sunspot</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Garfield_Lynns_(The_Batman_TV_Series)\">Garfield Lynns</a> (<i>The Batman</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Videos\">Videos</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRadiative-Heat_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0fbd8161c38d636aa1e8c87c1fe4fa2d\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><di